   "tex": "\\mathrm{LS}^{A}_{t}=R^{A}_{\\mathrm{G10},t}-R^{A}_{\\mathrm{G1},t},\\qquad r_{AB,P}=\\frac{\\sum_{t\\in\\mathcal{T}_P}\\left(\\mathrm{LS}^{A}_{t}-\\overline{\\mathrm{LS}}^{A}\\right)\\left(\\mathrm{LS}^{B}_{t}-\\overline{\\mathrm{LS}}^{B}\\right)}{\\sqrt{\\sum_{t\\in\\mathcal{T}_P}\\left(\\mathrm{LS}^{A}_{t}-\\overline{\\mathrm{LS}}^{A}\\right)^{2}}\\,\\sqrt{\\sum_{t\\in\\mathcal{T}_P}\\left(\\mathrm{LS}^{B}_{t}-\\overline{\\mathrm{LS}}^{B}\\right)^{2}}}",
